    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive a Harsh New World</strong> \u2013 Explore a barely-colonized, half-terraformed planet where life clings to the edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Planet Full of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Magnetic storms, ancient tech, and strange energy shape the land\u2014and your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Destructible Voxel Terrain</strong> \u2013 Dig, carve, and reshape the world in real time. The ground itself is part of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight with Purpose</strong> \u2013 Tight, first-person shooting with sci-fi weapons built from what you scavenge and upgrade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together</strong> \u2013 Drop in with a friend for full co-op support. Explore, survive, and solve mysteries as a team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Vehicle is Home</strong> \u2013 Drive, upgrade, and rely on your mobile base to get through deadly zones and carry your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart, Natural Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Use power, magnetism, and the environment to unlock paths and uncover hidden tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World Changes Around You</strong> \u2013 Violent storms, shifting terrain, and unstable energy keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover What Happened</strong> \u2013 Dig through old transmissions, abandoned stations, and buried systems to find the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Without Limits</strong> \u2013 No loading screens. Just you, your tools, and a wide open world that doesn\u2019t wait for you.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive a Harsh New World</strong> \u2013 Explore a barely-colonized, half-terraformed planet where life clings to the edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Planet Full of Secrets</strong> \u2013 Magnetic storms, ancient tech, and strange energy shape the land\u2014and your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Destructible Voxel Terrain</strong> \u2013 Dig, carve, and reshape the world in real time. The ground itself is part of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight with Purpose</strong> \u2013 Tight, first-person shooting with sci-fi weapons built from what you scavenge and upgrade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together</strong> \u2013 Drop in with a friend for full co-op support. Explore, survive, and solve mysteries as a team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Vehicle is Home</strong> \u2013 Drive, upgrade, and rely on your mobile base to get through deadly zones and carry your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart, Natural Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Use power, magnetism, and the environment to unlock paths and uncover hidden tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World Changes Around You</strong> \u2013 Violent storms, shifting terrain, and unstable energy keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover What Happened</strong> \u2013 Dig through old transmissions, abandoned stations, and buried systems to find the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Without Limits</strong> \u2013 No loading screens. Just you, your tools, and a wide open world that doesn\u2019t wait for you.</p></li></ul>",
